{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_title", "source_sha256": "0be6f3bfa2812c71ea59a024e8bc63ea54f4f53efef5f4f5fc150653a968ba11", "ja": "あの空に手が届くまで", "zh": "直到触及那片蓝天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_synopsis", "source_sha256": "210fc50a363b5dbd58c25062ef2068de222a4a5217eb624cc5c91e131dafb4f7", "ja": "次の公演のセンターを任され、気合い充分の\n紗代子。公演に向け、仲間と特訓を開始。\n限界を超えた練習内容に、全員ヘトヘトに\nなるが、紗代子達はやりきったことで\n大きな自信を手に入れる。", "zh": "纱代子获选为下次公演的Center而干劲十足，\n与伙伴们一起针对公演展开特训。\n超越极限的练习内容使得全员都筋疲力竭，\n却也为撑到最后的纱代子等人带来极大自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1000_p", "source_sha256": "636ff0e3dd039caef39c0444265788ad6e3096b25119d71b815f5a204782d49b", "ja": "（公演が終わっても、拍手が鳴りやむ気配がない。\n本番中の熱気が、今も劇場を包んでいる……）", "zh": "（公演结束后，掌声仍不绝于耳。\n正式演出时的热烈气氛，现在仍环绕着剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "bf1ce6749606d702b51eccc193c473895eca6d7082de5ed27e83c2afc896b1e4", "ja": "{$P$}！\n私たちのステージ、どうでした！？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我们的表演怎么样呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1002_p", "source_sha256": "35fb16db78e11084b4bc47be8aae43473398618dd93d9c8e2be74ad5acf87557", "ja": "ああ、紗代子はもちろん、全員がキラキラと輝く、\n最高のステージだったな。……よかったぞ！", "zh": "嗯，不只纱代子，所有人都闪闪发光，\n这是一场最棒的表演……你们表现得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "856bd73d76be06e9468ecf0b4bf08e2c5c43ff078646c05cb31de821b321b6bb", "ja": "へへ、なんか今日は、すっげー体が軽くてさ！\n今までで一番ビシッと決められた気がするんだよな～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我总觉得今天身体好轻盈！\n感觉这是我至今为止表现得最完美的一次～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "31127ca0978b7ccd089788b7d68436ec58a1209490cad6be52b18fc303ce7d1a", "ja": "わかる！　アタシも全然息が上がらなかったんだよね。\nもう1ステージくらい余裕でいけそうだよ！", "zh": "我懂！我也一点都不喘，\n感觉还有余力再表演一场呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1005_p", "source_sha256": "78fd6b4d1d854620d85759d3e69060b6d485f644c1d88aaccff4db6ab331c69a", "ja": "体力作りをしっかりやった成果かな。\n余裕があるほど、パフォーマンスも上がるし。", "zh": "这是你们努力锻炼体力的成果呢。\n越是有余力，表现得也会越好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "1aa5b84c41054fe46d6211c97da545fa76e954e168192600a06c54501b54e5a1", "ja": "つまり、それもサヨの特訓のおかげってことだな！", "zh": "也就是说，这都要多亏纱代的特训啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "71bb20e30b4bbcbff2d4c6f05ca88f471eb2c6986773217daa216ff583369266", "ja": "私もそう思います！　おかげで私、\n今日のステージで新しい風を感じることができました！", "zh": "我也这么觉得！多亏特训，\n我今天在舞台上感受到前所未有的风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "6111b1b4e53b0759ba4b5df0b5085476e276dd4f3daef6f708910eca72b39e6a", "ja": "ふふ、そう言ってもらえるとすごく嬉しいな。\nみんな、ありがとう！", "zh": "呵呵，听你们这么说，我好开心。\n各位，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "6a7cd1289b671361703477400cb75b471ec74856c0be888d731a667a6a218036", "ja": "でも、私……ステージの上で、みんなとは\nちょっと違うことを感じちゃってたかもしれない。", "zh": "不过……我在舞台上的感受，\n或许跟大家有点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "fa6e01919e5b428d927f706ef7546905720759ba404f2d20270271870083f17e", "ja": "私たちの限界は、まだまだ先にあるって！", "zh": "那就是我们还远远不到极限！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "80aa5f165e2d5db6a44ccb41642c32c1b151ff8fa610bc05314e746f225bbae6", "ja": "だから私、まだ満足したくない。\nこれからも一緒に、みんなでもっと先を目指そうよ！", "zh": "所以我还不想满足于现况。\n今后大家也一起朝更远大的目标前进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "e9222383537390dc89d229f65a041a4e184cf05e9d6ca1388581e219ff893484", "ja": "やれやれ、終わったばっかで言ってくれるぜ。\n……でも、キライじゃないね、そういうの！", "zh": "唉，你还真会强人所难，明明我们才刚表演完。\n……不过，我不讨厌这种感觉喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "501ce174d120bacb39ee0482d8aa133e94869848e604bf9a32d96092efdc6e37", "ja": "もっちろん！　いつかアイドル界のチャンピオンベルト\nを取れるように、みんなでがんばろう！　おー！", "zh": "当然好啰！为了总有一天能夺下偶像界的冠军腰带，\n让我们大家一起努力吧！哦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1014_se", "source_sha256": "31a547c8299dcfbf10e9167ab523c8f0ee1c83df180beeb002f34ddaa69276a6", "ja": "（グ～……）", "zh": "（咕噜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "3d2d4b2dd5f2af5b90722542bc77a78f51f71e556c99ef7015988178f44fb897", "ja": "うわ、ゴメン！　ハズいな～、ヘンなタイミングで\nお腹が……。でもオレ、もうお腹ぺこぺこでさぁ……。", "zh": "哇，抱歉！好丢脸喔～肚子也太会挑时间叫了……\n不过，我已经快饿扁啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "0337df074cd1c2cdcc6aaeab2307406c853866eb165fc14165dce4f8c8d16d7e", "ja": "ふふっ、いっぱい動きましたもんね。\n帰りにみんなで、どこか寄っていきませんか？", "zh": "呵呵，也难怪，表演的活动量很大嘛。\n回去的时候，要不要大家一起去哪吃饭呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "52074bbdf308106758a4074cd22a16835743aa5db5fc47a0faafb99f80dbd81e", "ja": "焼肉！　アタシ、焼肉がいい！\nねえ{$P$}、連れてってよ～！", "zh": "烤肉！我想吃烤肉！\n欸{$P$}，带我们去嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2abdb18e7b7403367a33d9359bd2fbbe9ba43326e12893e2e55e3c5eafca693d", "ja": "まあ、特訓含めて、みんなよく頑張ったしな……。\nよし。今回だけ特別に、カロリー補填と行こう！", "zh": "没办法，谁叫大家从特训开始就这么努力……\n好，这次就特别带大家去补充卡路里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太棒了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太棒了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "4ed9af3dfb2672592f279cc3af1c0c1b8adc0a5956191ff696e326ea039743c1", "ja": "よっしゃ！", "zh": "好耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "3066d3d3a9e9d1ee7db3b7ff6a9ec0ed802b62a35721af8f772aa8e12c80016f", "ja": "ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "谢谢你，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "baca39e511674636b97132ab625418a7fe1a352dc61b81a1f97f2cc2e38c3cfd", "ja": "サンキュ、{$P$}！　へへ、みんな、\n早く着替えに行こうぜ！　やっきにく、やっきにく～♪", "zh": "谢啦，{$P$}！嘿嘿，大家，\n我们赶快去换衣服吧！烤肉、烤肉～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1024_p", "source_sha256": "899231de0d772e0f8a13c81d3d5a2f78732d18af6e4700edcd49b6bb3c813605", "ja": "あれ、紗代子は行かないのか？", "zh": "咦，纱代子你不过去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "881601d4fbb5bec125fdc7510245d144cee606c15032d7d19a1d38f9f2901f5d", "ja": "あ、はい。\nあの……着替える前に、もう1回だけ……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n就是那个……换衣服之前，我想再看一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1027_p", "source_sha256": "fd47e62c2d33715a2cda7ce295ece11a5abac6f18d4b6c84b4f3842e02968ff7", "ja": "紗代子？　客席がどうかしたのか？", "zh": "纱代子？观众席怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "ecd724a894fa216cbf5f23fcd5ff5400f9bb10ea42ec026775a26451538a7b3a", "ja": "いえ、いいんです！\nその、ちょっと気になっただけで。", "zh": "不，没事！\n那个，我只是有点在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "ada583b9a7215669c8ca8b5ba471b8ed3370a704b4550d3189a0836b40ab2299", "ja": "私の初めてのセンター公演……。\nもしかしたらって思ったんですけど、やっぱり……。", "zh": "这是我第一次担任Center的公演……\n我在想说不定……但果然还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "b64d08cc6865e5b92ebd2971749fd45d42e98ed0052dd31c04f0793d855e7f6d", "ja": "うん。やっぱり私、まだまだ頑張らなくちゃ！\nいつか、胸をはって出会えるように……。", "zh": "嗯，我果然还得更努力才行！\n为了总有一天能抬头挺胸重逢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "f6113a42b3b3cba95c09650f3ef7189f7440c5edbdc3a9cdcfa7d3d97a3b17b3", "ja": "いつかたどり着けるように！\n{$P$}、私、走り続けますね！", "zh": "为了总有一天能抵达目标！\n{$P$}，我会继续奔跑下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1032_p", "source_sha256": "af0bfd524f58cd30162ffe8bfda7187ebefebe59661b01387829ef8669f6d08d", "ja": "（紗代子の目指すゴールは、まだまだ先にあるらしい。\nだとしたら……）", "zh": "（纱代子视为目标的终点，似乎还在远方。\n既然如此……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_021_1033_p", "source_sha256": "066ba243a2e8e6c53596afc972848c12f44b5079d9141fd33dd63c5bd238c637", "ja": "（それがどこだろうと、この手でしっかり、\n送り届けてやらないとな！）", "zh": "（不管她的目标在哪，\n我都要亲手把她送到那个位置上！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
